Subject: [PATCH] Do not log secrets (QuickConnect, session logout)

Backport of the Emby.Server.Implementations part of upstream #18305.
The Schedules Direct hunk (src/Jellyfin.LiveTv) is left out: Live TV is
not used here and build.sh cannot map src/ projects.

(cherry picked from commit ed76cb36e5)
---
